<UserControl xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             x:Class="PilotX.Desktop.Views.OrbitXPanel">
    <!--
        OrbitXPanel — reemplazo nativo de pages/orbitx.html + js/orbitx.js.

        Sincronización con OrbitX Cloud: vinculación del tractor por código,
        estado del heartbeat, y la config de orbitX.json. Mismo wire que la
        página (OrbitXController): /api/orbitx/{config,status,test,pair-info,
        pair-reset}, todo snake_case. La página HTML NO se toca: el Hub remoto
        y la PWA del celular la siguen usando.

        Orden de secciones IDÉNTICO al original:
          1. Cabecera + pill "Sin verificar" / "Cloud conectado"
          2. Card de vinculación (pollea pair-info cada 4 s; oculta hasta la
             primera respuesta, igual que el display:none del HTML)
          3. Tabs: Estado · Config · OTA · Prescripciones
          4. Panes

        Ojo con lo que NO es funcional en el original y acá TAMPOCO lo es:
        la tab OTA es un MOCK visual (cuatro filas escritas a mano en el HTML,
        sin ningún fetch detrás) y la tab Prescripciones es solo un cartel que
        manda a la pantalla real. Se portan tal cual — "mejorarlas" sería
        inventar una funcionalidad que hoy no existe.

        server_url es READONLY por diseño: OrbitXConfigService la fuerza a
        FixedServerUrl en Load() y en Save(). Se muestra, no se edita.

        Card clara flotante con el mapa VIVO detrás (misma receta que
        EventosPanel / FirmwaresPanel): el mapa nunca se apaga ni se tapa del
        todo. NADA de ComboBox/Flyout: sobre el mapa GL no se dibujan y encima
        no logean error — el diálogo de "Desvincular" es Border + IsVisible.
    -->
    <ThemeVariantScope RequestedThemeVariant="Light">
        <Panel>

            <!-- ============================ CARD ============================
                 Name="Card": ModoEmbebido() (adentro de la Configuración) le
                 suelta el marco/tamaño; la instancia flotante no cambia. -->
            <Border Name="Card"
                    Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelCard}"
                    BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorderHigh}"
                    BorderThickness="1"
                    CornerRadius="14"
                    ClipToBounds="True"
                    BoxShadow="0 8 26 0 #33101612"
                    Padding="20,16,20,18"
                    MaxWidth="1060" MaxHeight="720"
                    HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                    Margin="16,8">
                <DockPanel>

                    <!-- ========================= Header =========================
                         Name="DragHandle": de acá se agarra para CORRER la card
                         sobre el mapa (PanelArrastrable). -->
                    <Grid DockPanel.Dock="Top" Name="DragHandle" Background="Transparent"
                          ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto,Auto" Margin="2,0,2,14">
                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Name="HeaderTitulo" Spacing="2"
                                    VerticalAlignment="Center">
                            <TextBlock Text="OrbitX"
                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                       FontSize="22"
                                       FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="Sincronización cloud · OTA · prescripciones"
                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                       FontSize="12"/>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- Pill de conexión (#connectedPill). Name="HeaderPills":
                             la instancia embebida la entrega (PillsDeContexto) a la
                             barra de contexto del shell. -->
                        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Name="HeaderPills"
                                    Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8"
                                    VerticalAlignment="Center">
                            <Border Name="ConnPill"
                                    Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface2}"
                                    BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorderHigh}"
                                    BorderThickness="1"
                                    CornerRadius="999"
                                    Padding="12,6,14,6"
                                    VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8"
                                            VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <Ellipse Name="ConnDot" Width="8" Height="8"
                                             Fill="{StaticResource PilotXPanelIdle}"
                                             VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Name="ConnText" Text="Sin verificar"
                                               Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                               FontSize="14"
                                               FontWeight="Medium"
                                               VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <Button Grid.Column="2" Name="BtnCerrar" Content="✕"
                                Click="OnCerrarClick"
                                ToolTip.Tip="Cerrar"
                                Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface}"
                                Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorderHigh}"
                                BorderThickness="1"
                                CornerRadius="8" Width="48" Height="48"
                                FontSize="15"
                                Margin="10,0,0,0"
                                HorizontalContentAlignment="Center"
                                VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                    </Grid>

                    <!-- ========================= Cuerpo ========================= -->
                    <ScrollViewer HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled"
                                  VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
                        <StackPanel Name="ContenidoRaiz" Spacing="0" Margin="2,0,8,0">

                            <!-- ================ Card de vinculación ================
                                 Arranca OCULTA (display:none del HTML) y aparece
                                 con la primera respuesta de /api/orbitx/pair-info.
                                 El borde cambia de color por estado:
                                   sin vincular → ámbar · vinculado → verde ·
                                   sin cloud    → rojo -->
                            <Border Name="PairCard" IsVisible="False"
                                    Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelWarnSoft}"
                                    BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelWarn}"
                                    BorderThickness="2"
                                    CornerRadius="10"
                                    Padding="20"
                                    Margin="0,0,0,20">
                                <StackPanel Spacing="0">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="12"
                                                Margin="0,0,0,12">
                                        <TextBlock Name="PairTitle"
                                                   Text="Vinculación con OrbitX Cloud"
                                                   Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                   FontSize="20"
                                                   FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                                   TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                   VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                        <Border Name="PairStatePill"
                                                Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelWarnSoft}"
                                                BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelWarn}"
                                                BorderThickness="1"
                                                CornerRadius="999"
                                                Padding="12,4,12,4"
                                                VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                            <TextBlock Name="PairStateText" Text="conectando…"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelWarn}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       FontWeight="Medium"
                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                        </Border>
                                    </StackPanel>

                                    <!-- Lo arma el código (RenderPair*). Arranca en
                                         "Cargando…" igual que el HTML, y el primer
                                         render lo reemplaza entero. -->
                                    <StackPanel Name="PairBody" Spacing="0">
                                        <TextBlock Text="Cargando…"
                                                   Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                   FontSize="14"
                                                   TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- ========================= Tabs ========================= -->
                            <Border BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"
                                    BorderThickness="0,0,0,1"
                                    Margin="0,0,0,20">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                                    <Button Name="TabEstado" Content="Estado" Tag="estado"
                                            Click="OnTabClick"
                                            Background="Transparent"
                                            Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                            BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelAccent}"
                                            BorderThickness="0,0,0,2"
                                            CornerRadius="8,8,0,0"
                                            Padding="16,12,16,12"
                                            MinHeight="48"
                                            FontSize="15"
                                            FontWeight="Medium"/>
                                    <Button Name="TabConfig" Content="Config" Tag="config"
                                            Click="OnTabClick"
                                            Background="Transparent"
                                            Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                            BorderBrush="Transparent"
                                            BorderThickness="0,0,0,2"
                                            CornerRadius="8,8,0,0"
                                            Padding="16,12,16,12"
                                            MinHeight="48"
                                            FontSize="15"/>
                                    <Button Name="TabOta" Content="OTA" Tag="ota"
                                            Click="OnTabClick"
                                            Background="Transparent"
                                            Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                            BorderBrush="Transparent"
                                            BorderThickness="0,0,0,2"
                                            CornerRadius="8,8,0,0"
                                            Padding="16,12,16,12"
                                            MinHeight="48"
                                            FontSize="15"/>
                                    <Button Name="TabPresc" Content="Prescripciones" Tag="presc"
                                            Click="OnTabClick"
                                            Background="Transparent"
                                            Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                            BorderBrush="Transparent"
                                            BorderThickness="0,0,0,2"
                                            CornerRadius="8,8,0,0"
                                            Padding="16,12,16,12"
                                            MinHeight="48"
                                            FontSize="15"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- ======================== PANE: ESTADO ========================
                                 Las 4 cards del .grid (auto-fit minmax(280px,1fr)):
                                 el código reacomoda columnas/filas según el ancho. -->
                            <Grid Name="PaneEstado" ColumnDefinitions="*,*,*,*" RowDefinitions="Auto">

                                <!-- Heartbeat -->
                                <Border Name="CardHeartbeat" Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0"
                                        Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface}"
                                        BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"
                                        BorderThickness="1"
                                        CornerRadius="10"
                                        Padding="20"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Top">
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="0">
                                        <TextBlock Text="Heartbeat"
                                                   Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                   FontSize="16"
                                                   FontWeight="Medium"
                                                   LetterSpacing="0.5"
                                                   Margin="0,0,0,12"/>
                                        <TextBlock Name="EstHeartbeat" Text="off"
                                                   Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                   FontSize="24"
                                                   FontWeight="Bold"
                                                   FontFamily="Consolas, Courier New, monospace"/>
                                        <Border Height="1"
                                                Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"
                                                Margin="0,16,0,12"/>
                                        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*">
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Último sync"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                       FontSize="14"/>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Name="EstUltimoSync" Text="—"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                                       TextAlignment="Right"
                                                       TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                       Margin="8,0,0,0"/>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>

                                <!-- Cola sync -->
                                <Border Name="CardCola" Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1"
                                        Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface}"
                                        BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"
                                        BorderThickness="1"
                                        CornerRadius="10"
                                        Padding="20"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Top">
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="0">
                                        <TextBlock Text="Cola sync"
                                                   Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                   FontSize="16"
                                                   FontWeight="Medium"
                                                   LetterSpacing="0.5"
                                                   Margin="0,0,0,12"/>
                                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8"
                                                    VerticalAlignment="Bottom">
                                            <TextBlock Name="EstArchivos" Text="0"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                       FontSize="48"
                                                       FontWeight="Bold"
                                                       FontFamily="Consolas, Courier New, monospace"
                                                       VerticalAlignment="Bottom"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="arch"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                       FontSize="20"
                                                       VerticalAlignment="Bottom"
                                                       Margin="0,0,0,4"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                        <Border Height="1"
                                                Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"
                                                Margin="0,16,0,12"/>
                                        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*">
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Total subidos"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                       FontSize="14"/>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="acumulado"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                                       TextAlignment="Right"
                                                       Margin="8,0,0,0"/>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>

                                <!-- Establecimiento -->
                                <Border Name="CardEstab" Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="2"
                                        Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface}"
                                        BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"
                                        BorderThickness="1"
                                        CornerRadius="10"
                                        Padding="20"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Top">
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="0">
                                        <TextBlock Text="Establecimiento"
                                                   Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                   FontSize="16"
                                                   FontWeight="Medium"
                                                   LetterSpacing="0.5"
                                                   Margin="0,0,0,12"/>
                                        <TextBlock Name="EstEstab" Text="—"
                                                   Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                   FontSize="24"
                                                   FontWeight="Bold"
                                                   FontFamily="Consolas, Courier New, monospace"
                                                   TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                                        <Border Height="1"
                                                Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"
                                                Margin="0,16,0,12"/>
                                        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*">
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Device ID"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                       FontSize="14"/>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Name="EstDeviceId" Text="—"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                                       FontFamily="Consolas, Courier New, monospace"
                                                       TextAlignment="Right"
                                                       TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                       Margin="8,0,0,0"/>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>

                                <!-- Estado conexión -->
                                <Border Name="CardConexion" Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="3"
                                        Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface}"
                                        BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"
                                        BorderThickness="1"
                                        CornerRadius="10"
                                        Padding="20"
                                        VerticalAlignment="Top">
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="0">
                                        <TextBlock Text="Estado conexión"
                                                   Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                   FontSize="16"
                                                   FontWeight="Medium"
                                                   LetterSpacing="0.5"
                                                   Margin="0,0,0,12"/>
                                        <TextBlock Name="EstConexion" Text="—"
                                                   Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                   FontSize="24"
                                                   FontWeight="Bold"
                                                   FontFamily="Consolas, Courier New, monospace"/>
                                        <Border Height="1"
                                                Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"
                                                Margin="0,16,0,12"/>
                                        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*">
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0" Text="Último error"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                       FontSize="14"/>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Name="EstUltimoError" Text="ninguno"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                                       TextAlignment="Right"
                                                       TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                       Margin="8,0,0,0"/>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>
                            </Grid>

                            <!-- ======================== PANE: CONFIG ======================== -->
                            <Border Name="PaneConfig" IsVisible="False"
                                    Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface}"
                                    BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"
                                    BorderThickness="1"
                                    CornerRadius="10"
                                    Padding="20"
                                    MaxWidth="820"
                                    HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                                <StackPanel Spacing="0">

                                    <!-- Server URL: informativa, NO editable.
                                         OrbitXConfigService.FixedServerUrl la fuerza
                                         en Load() y en Save() — pedido explícito
                                         2026-05-27. -->
                                    <TextBlock Text="Server URL"
                                               Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                               FontSize="14"
                                               FontWeight="Medium"
                                               Margin="0,0,0,8"/>
                                    <Border Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface2}"
                                            BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"
                                            BorderThickness="1"
                                            CornerRadius="8"
                                            Padding="12,10,12,10">
                                        <SelectableTextBlock Name="CfgServerUrl"
                                                             Text="https://orbitx.agroparallel.com"
                                                             Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                             FontSize="14"
                                                             FontFamily="Consolas, Courier New, monospace"
                                                             TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                                    </Border>
                                    <TextBlock Text="Fija por sistema — no se edita desde la UI."
                                               Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                               FontSize="11"
                                               Margin="0,4,0,12"/>

                                    <!-- Grilla de 2 columnas del original -->
                                    <Grid Name="CfgGrid" ColumnDefinitions="*,*" RowDefinitions="Auto,Auto">
                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Spacing="8"
                                                    Margin="0,0,8,16">
                                            <TextBlock Text="Establecimiento slug"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       FontWeight="Medium"/>
                                            <TextBox Name="CfgEstabSlug" Text=""
                                                     MinHeight="48"
                                                     FontSize="16"
                                                     CornerRadius="8"
                                                     Padding="12,0,12,0"
                                                     VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                                     Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface}"
                                                     Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                     BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorderHigh}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>

                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Spacing="8"
                                                    Margin="8,0,0,16">
                                            <TextBlock Text="Device ID"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       FontWeight="Medium"/>
                                            <TextBox Name="CfgDeviceId" Text=""
                                                     IsReadOnly="True"
                                                     MinHeight="48"
                                                     FontSize="16"
                                                     CornerRadius="8"
                                                     Padding="12,0,12,0"
                                                     VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                                     Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface2}"
                                                     Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                     BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorderHigh}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>

                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="0" Spacing="8"
                                                    Margin="0,0,8,16">
                                            <TextBlock Text="Device Token"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       FontWeight="Medium"/>
                                            <TextBox Name="CfgDeviceToken" Text=""
                                                     MinHeight="48"
                                                     FontSize="16"
                                                     CornerRadius="8"
                                                     Padding="12,0,12,0"
                                                     VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                                     Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface}"
                                                     Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                     BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorderHigh}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>

                                        <StackPanel Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="1" Spacing="8"
                                                    Margin="8,0,0,16">
                                            <TextBlock Text="Sync interval (s)"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       FontWeight="Medium"/>
                                            <TextBox Name="CfgSyncInterval" Text=""
                                                     MinHeight="48"
                                                     FontSize="16"
                                                     CornerRadius="8"
                                                     Padding="12,0,12,0"
                                                     VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                                     Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface}"
                                                     Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                     BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorderHigh}"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </Grid>

                                    <!-- Los 5 toggles del original, en el MISMO orden -->
                                    <WrapPanel Name="CfgToggles" Margin="0,0,0,4">
                                        <CheckBox Name="ChkEnabled" Content="Enabled"
                                                  MinHeight="48" FontSize="14"
                                                  Margin="0,0,16,0"
                                                  Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"/>
                                        <CheckBox Name="ChkSyncAog" Content="Sync Piloto"
                                                  MinHeight="48" FontSize="14"
                                                  Margin="0,0,16,0"
                                                  Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"/>
                                        <CheckBox Name="ChkSyncVistaX" Content="Sync VistaX"
                                                  MinHeight="48" FontSize="14"
                                                  Margin="0,0,16,0"
                                                  Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"/>
                                        <CheckBox Name="ChkSyncQuantiX" Content="Sync QuantiX"
                                                  MinHeight="48" FontSize="14"
                                                  Margin="0,0,16,0"
                                                  Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"/>
                                        <CheckBox Name="ChkSyncSectionX" Content="Sync SectionX"
                                                  MinHeight="48" FontSize="14"
                                                  Margin="0,0,16,0"
                                                  Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"/>
                                    </WrapPanel>

                                    <!-- Acciones + hint -->
                                    <WrapPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                                        <Button Name="BtnGuardar" Content="Guardar"
                                                Click="OnGuardarClick"
                                                Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelAccent}"
                                                Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                BorderThickness="0"
                                                CornerRadius="8"
                                                MinHeight="52"
                                                Padding="24,0,24,0"
                                                FontSize="15"
                                                FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                                Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
                                        <Button Name="BtnProbar" Content="Probar conexión"
                                                Click="OnProbarClick"
                                                Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface}"
                                                Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorderHigh}"
                                                BorderThickness="1"
                                                CornerRadius="8"
                                                MinHeight="52"
                                                Padding="24,0,24,0"
                                                FontSize="15"
                                                Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
                                        <TextBlock Name="FormHint" Text=""
                                                   Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                   FontSize="14"
                                                   TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                   VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    </WrapPanel>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- ========================= PANE: OTA =========================
                                 MOCK VISUAL, igual que el HTML: las cuatro filas
                                 están escritas a mano y los botones no llaman a
                                 nada. La gestión OTA real vive en el detalle del
                                 nodo. Se porta tal cual para no inventar una
                                 funcionalidad que hoy no existe. -->
                            <StackPanel Name="PaneOta" IsVisible="False" Spacing="0">
                                <Border Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface}"
                                        BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"
                                        BorderThickness="1"
                                        CornerRadius="10"
                                        Padding="20">
                                    <StackPanel Spacing="0">

                                        <!-- fila 1 -->
                                        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,110,110,160" Margin="0,12,0,12">
                                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="2">
                                                <TextBlock Text="QuantiX node · Motor 1"
                                                           Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                           FontSize="14"
                                                           FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="QX-A1B2C3D4 · 192.168.5.21"
                                                           Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                           FontSize="14"
                                                           FontFamily="Consolas, Courier New, monospace"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="v1.4.2"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="v1.5.0 ↑"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                            <Button Grid.Column="3" Content="Actualizar"
                                                    Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelAccent}"
                                                    Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                    BorderThickness="0"
                                                    CornerRadius="8"
                                                    MinHeight="44"
                                                    Padding="16,0,16,0"
                                                    FontSize="14"
                                                    FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                                    HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                                                    VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                        </Grid>
                                        <Border Height="1" Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"/>

                                        <!-- fila 2 -->
                                        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,110,110,160" Margin="0,12,0,12">
                                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="2">
                                                <TextBlock Text="QuantiX node · Motor 2"
                                                           Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                           FontSize="14"
                                                           FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="QX-E5F6A7B8 · 192.168.5.22"
                                                           Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                           FontSize="14"
                                                           FontFamily="Consolas, Courier New, monospace"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="v1.5.0"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="—"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                            <Border Grid.Column="3"
                                                    Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelOkSoft}"
                                                    BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelOk}"
                                                    BorderThickness="1"
                                                    CornerRadius="999"
                                                    Padding="12,4,14,4"
                                                    HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                                                    VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8"
                                                            VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                                    <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8"
                                                             Fill="{StaticResource PilotXPanelOk}"
                                                             VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                                    <TextBlock Text="al día"
                                                               Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelOk}"
                                                               FontSize="14"
                                                               FontWeight="Medium"
                                                               VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                                </StackPanel>
                                            </Border>
                                        </Grid>
                                        <Border Height="1" Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"/>

                                        <!-- fila 3 -->
                                        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,110,110,160" Margin="0,12,0,12">
                                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="2">
                                                <TextBlock Text="SectionX controller"
                                                           Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                           FontSize="14"
                                                           FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="SX-1F2E3D4C · 192.168.5.30"
                                                           Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                           FontSize="14"
                                                           FontFamily="Consolas, Courier New, monospace"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="v0.9.1"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="v1.0.0 ↑"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                            <!-- .progress con width:62% (dibujado, no vivo) -->
                                            <Border Grid.Column="3" Name="OtaProgresoRiel"
                                                    Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface2}"
                                                    CornerRadius="4"
                                                    Height="8"
                                                    ClipToBounds="True"
                                                    VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                    Margin="0,0,8,0">
                                                <Border Name="OtaProgresoBarra"
                                                        Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelAccent}"
                                                        HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                                        CornerRadius="4"
                                                        Width="0"/>
                                            </Border>
                                        </Grid>
                                        <Border Height="1" Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"/>

                                        <!-- fila 4 -->
                                        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,110,110,160" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="2">
                                                <TextBlock Text="VistaX hub"
                                                           Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                           FontSize="14"
                                                           FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="VX-9C8B7A65 · 192.168.5.40"
                                                           Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                                           FontSize="14"
                                                           FontFamily="Consolas, Courier New, monospace"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="v2.1.0"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="v2.2.1 ↑"
                                                       Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                       FontSize="14"
                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                            <Button Grid.Column="3" Content="Actualizar"
                                                    Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelAccent}"
                                                    Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                                    BorderThickness="0"
                                                    CornerRadius="8"
                                                    MinHeight="44"
                                                    Padding="16,0,16,0"
                                                    FontSize="14"
                                                    FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                                    HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                                                    VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>

                                <TextBlock Text="La gestión OTA todavía corre desde el shell legacy. Estamos migrando a la API."
                                           Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                           FontSize="14"
                                           TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                           Margin="0,12,0,0"/>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <!-- ==================== PANE: PRESCRIPCIONES ====================
                                 La descarga/activación YA anda (OrbitXSync.CheckPrescriptions
                                 + PrescripcionService): esta tab solo manda a la pantalla
                                 real, para no tener dos UIs que se desincronicen. -->
                            <Border Name="PanePresc" IsVisible="False"
                                    Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface}"
                                    BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorder}"
                                    BorderThickness="1"
                                    CornerRadius="10"
                                    Padding="20">
                                <StackPanel Spacing="12" HorizontalAlignment="Center">
                                    <TextBlock Name="PrescTexto"
                                               Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                               FontSize="16"
                                               TextAlignment="Center"
                                               TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                               MaxWidth="620"/>
                                    <Button Name="BtnAbrirPresc" Content="Abrir Prescripciones"
                                            Click="OnAbrirPrescClick"
                                            Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelAccent}"
                                            Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                            BorderThickness="0"
                                            CornerRadius="8"
                                            MinHeight="52"
                                            Padding="24,0,24,0"
                                            FontSize="15"
                                            FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                            HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                        </StackPanel>
                    </ScrollViewer>
                </DockPanel>
            </Border>

            <!-- ===================== DIÁLOGO (AgpModal) =====================
                 confirm() de "Desvincular OrbitX" y alert() del error del
                 pair-reset. Border + IsVisible, NUNCA Flyout: sobre el mapa GL
                 no se dibujan y no logean error. -->
            <Border Name="ModalOverlay" IsVisible="False" ZIndex="60"
                    Background="#66101612"
                    PointerPressed="OnModalBackdropPressed">
                <Border Name="ModalCard"
                        Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelCard}"
                        BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorderHigh}"
                        BorderThickness="1"
                        CornerRadius="14"
                        Padding="16"
                        Width="500"
                        BoxShadow="0 8 26 0 #33101612"
                        HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                        PointerPressed="OnModalCardPressed">
                    <StackPanel Spacing="10">
                        <TextBlock Name="ModalTitulo" Text=""
                                   Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                   FontSize="16" FontWeight="Bold"/>
                        <TextBlock Name="ModalMensaje" Text=""
                                   Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelTextDim}"
                                   FontSize="13" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="10"
                                    HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,4,0,0">
                            <Button Name="BtnModalCancelar" Content="Cancelar"
                                    Click="OnModalCancelarClick"
                                    Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelSurface}"
                                    Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                    BorderBrush="{StaticResource PilotXPanelBorderHigh}"
                                    BorderThickness="1"
                                    CornerRadius="8" MinHeight="44" Padding="20,0,20,0"/>
                            <Button Name="BtnModalConfirmar" Content="Aceptar"
                                    Click="OnModalConfirmarClick"
                                    Background="{StaticResource PilotXPanelAccent}"
                                    Foreground="{StaticResource PilotXPanelText}"
                                    BorderThickness="0"
                                    CornerRadius="8" MinHeight="44" Padding="20,0,20,0"
                                    FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </Border>
        </Panel>
    </ThemeVariantScope>
</UserControl>
